@startuml C4-Container

title Multi-Agent Game Strategy - Container Level

actor Player

rectangle "Multi-Agent Game Strategy System" as System {

    rectangle "Input Module" as Input

    rectangle "Agent Coordinator" as Agent

    rectangle "Search Engine" as Search

    rectangle "Visited Memory" as Memory

    rectangle "Output Module" as Output
}

Player --> Input : Provides game / maze input
Input --> Agent : Sends problem details
Agent --> Search : Selects BFS / DFS
Search --> Memory : Tracks visited nodes
Search --> Output : Returns search result
Output --> Player : Displays result

@enduml